200&s=f647a3ff4137c63e875c8942447af05a, https://si.imgix.net/08a3b0bf/requests/116615_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61a274e0690e67d74839b18f2763b36b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/08a3b0bf/requests/116615_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ed48f9719f104765ff6cdcca0aa6e47 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "8月に入ったということで、今回はぽんちくんと「肝試し」をテーマにした一枚絵をよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@siratamairipafe/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea5f9067/requests/102300_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1edb1a9ec0a19927079cd3db39b1d7cf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ea5f9067/requests/102300_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1edb1a9ec0a19927079cd3db39b1d7cf, https://si.imgix.net/ea5f9067/requests/102300_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d57ad35c0a61c2ae7cd064e2626ac936 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ea5f9067/requests/102300_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65a295b7bd36db308d8ac867f012a625 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "もめんさんの夏休みが見たいです。\n一枚絵をお願いいたします。\n\n（絵本のご準備でお忙しいかと存じます。完成急ぎません！よろしくお願いいたします。）", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@siratamairipafe/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/36795e79/requests/111633_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f0fd85ac8e4ffbfb36f921b0895c687f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/36795e79/requests/111633_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f0fd85ac8e4ffbfb36f921b0895c687f, https://si.imgix.net/36795e79/requests/111633_1?bg